\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-3-5\" data-name=\"chevron right icon\"></i>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex shrink-0 flex-col gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"browsing controls container\">\n<div class=\"grid shrink-0 grid-cols-4 gap-1 overflow-hidden rounded-[14px] bg-[#EBF0EC] p-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"browse mode tab bar\">\n<span class=\"flex h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-[11px] bg-white text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-[#059669] shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(17,28,24,0.08)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"Sureler active tab\">Sureler</span>\n<span class=\"flex h-11 items-center justify-center text-[12.5px] text-[#52635B]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"Cüzler tab\">Cüzler</span>\n<span class=\"flex h-11 items-center justify-center text-[12.5px] text-[#52635B]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-4-1-3\" data-name=\"Konular tab\">Konular</span>\n<span class=\"flex h-11 items-center justify-center text-[12.5px] text-[#52635B]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-4-1-4\" data-name=\"Favoriler tab\">Favoriler</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-12 items-center gap-2 rounded-[14px] border border-[#DCE4DF] bg-white px-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"chapter search field\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-search text-[16px] text-[#73857C]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"search icon\"></i>\n<span class=\"text-[13px] text-[#9BA9A2]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"search placeholder label\">Sure adı veya numarası ara</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-11 items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-4-3\" data-name=\"ordering controls row\">\n<span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-[#52635B]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-4-3-1\" data-name=\"ordering label\">Sıra</span>\n<div class=\"flex h-9 items-center gap-1 rounded-[10px] bg-[#EBF0EC] p-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-4-3-2\" data-name=\"ordering toggle\">\n<span class=\"rounded-[8px] bg-white px-3 py-1 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#111C18] shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(17,28,24,0.08)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-4-3-2-1\" data-name=\"Mushaf option active\">Mushaf</span>\n<span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-[12px] text-[#52635B]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-4-3-2-2\" data-name=\"Nüzul option\">Nüzul</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"h-[204px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[18px] border border-[#DCE4DF] bg-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5\" data-name=\"chapter list card\">\n<div class=\"flex h-[68px] items-center gap-3.5 border-b border-[#EDF1EE] px-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"chapter list item wrapper\">\n<span class=\"w-5 shrink-0 text-[12px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#8DA196]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"chapter list number label\">1</span>\n<div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-1-2\" data-name=\"chapter title container\">\n<p class=\"truncate text-[15px] font-semibold leading-5 text-[#111C18]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"chapter title text\">Fâtiha</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11.5px] text-[#73857C]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"chapter metadata row\">\n<span class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[16px] leading-[20px] text-[#3B4D45]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"chapter Arabic name\" style=\"font-family:'Amiri',serif\">الفاتحة</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"chapter revelation info\">Nüzul 5</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"shrink-0 text-[12.5px] tabular-nums text-[#52635B]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-1-3\" data-name=\"chapter verse count\">7 ayet</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-[68px] items-center gap-3.5 border-b border-[#EDF1EE] px-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-2\" data-name=\"chapter list item 2\">\n<span class=\"w-5 shrink-0 text-[12px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#8DA196]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"chapter list number 2\">2</span>\n<div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"chapter title container 2\">\n<p class=\"truncate text-[15px] font-semibold leading-5 text-[#111C18]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-2-2-1\" data-name=\"chapter title 2\">Bakara</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11.5px] text-[#73857C]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-2-2-2\" data-name=\"chapter metadata row 2\">\n<span class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[16px] leading-[20px] text-[#3B4D45]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"chapter Arabic name 2\" style=\"font-family:'Amiri',serif\">البقرة</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"chapter revelation info 2\">Nüzul 87</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"shrink-0 text-[12.5px] tabular-nums text-[#52635B]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-2-3\" data-name=\"chapter verse count 2\">286 ayet</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-[68px] items-center gap-3.5 px-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-3\" data-name=\"chapter list item 3\">\n<span class=\"w-5 shrink-0 text-[12px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#8DA196]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-3-1\" data-name=\"chapter list number 3\">3</span>\n<div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-3-2\" data-name=\"chapter title container 3\">\n<p class=\"truncate text-[15px] font-semibold leading-5 text-[#111C18]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-3-2-1\" data-name=\"chapter title 3\">Âl-i İmrân</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11.5px] text-[#73857C]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-3-2-2\" data-name=\"chapter metadata row 3\">\n<span class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[16px] leading-[20px] text-[#3B4D45]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"chapter Arabic name 3\" style=\"font-family:'Amiri',serif\">آل عمران</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"chapter revelation info 3\">Nüzul 89</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"shrink-0 text-[12.5px] tabular-nums text-[#52635B]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-5-3-3\" data-name=\"chapter verse count 3\">200 ayet</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-16 shrink-0 items-stretch border-t border-[#DCE4DF] bg-white px-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"Kur'an bottom tab bar\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-[#52635B]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"home tab item\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-home text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"home icon\"></i><span class=\"text-[10px] leading-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"home tab label\">Bugün</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-[#059669]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"Kur'an active tab item\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-book-2 text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"Kur'an tab icon\"></i><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold leading-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"Kur'an tab label\">Kur'an</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-[#52635B]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"ibadet tab item\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-moon-stars text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"ibadet tab icon\"></i><span class=\"text-[10px] leading-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"ibadet tab label\">İbadet</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-[#52635B]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3-4\" data-name=\"takvim tab item\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-calendar text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"takvim tab icon\"></i><span class=\"text-[10px] leading-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"takvim tab label\">Takvim</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-[#52635B]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3-5\" data-name=\"discover tab item\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-compass text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3-5-1\" data-name=\"compass tab icon\"></i><span class=\"text-[10px] leading-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3-5-2\" data-name=\"discover tab label\">Keşfet</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- ================= İBADET ================= -->\n<div class=\"w-[375px] shrink-0\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\" data-name=\"İbadet phone mockup\">\n<p class=\"mb-2 pl-1 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#52635B]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"İbadet mockup screen label\">İbadet</p>\n<div class=\"flex h-[812px] w-[375px] flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[30px] bg-[#F5F7F5] shadow-[0_24px_50px_-30px_rgba(17,28,24,0.5)] ring-1 ring-[#C7D2CB]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"İbadet phone screen frame\">\n<div class=\"flex h-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-between px-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"phone status bar\">\n<span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#111C18]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"phone clock time\">16:10</span>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] text-[#111C18]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"status bar icons row\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-wifi\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"wifi icon\"></i><i class=\"ti ti-battery-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"battery icon\"></i>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col overflow-hidden px-4 pt-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"İbadet screen content area\">\n<div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-start justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"İbadet screen header wrapper\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"İbadet screen header\">\n<h1 class=\"text-[24px] font-semibold leading-8 tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#111C18]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"İbadet screen title\">İbadet</h1>\n<p class=\"mt-1 text-[12.5px] leading-4 text-[#52635B]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"İbadet screen subtitle\">Zikirmatik, namaz ve kaza takibi</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-1.5 text-right\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"prayer progress summary\">\n<p class=\"text-[10.5px] text-[#73857C]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"summary day label\">Bugün</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#059669]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"prayer count summary\">3/5 vakit</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-4 grid shrink-0 grid-cols-3 gap-1 overflow-hidden rou