605A]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"sort label\">Sıra: Mushaf</span>\n<span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[11.5px] font-bold text-[#0B1411]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"toggle sort button\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-arrows-sort text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"sort icon\"></i>Değiştir\n              </span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] ring-1 ring-[#DDE3E0]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5\" data-name=\"surat list\">\n<div class=\"flex h-[62px] items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-[#DDE3E0] px-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-1\" data-name=\"surat row 1\">\n<span class=\"w-5 shrink-0 text-[11.5px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#9AA49E]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-1-1\" data-name=\"surat number\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">1</span>\n<div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-1-2\" data-name=\"surat names container\">\n<p class=\"truncate text-[14px] font-semibold leading-5 tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#0B1411]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"Turkish surat name\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">Fâtiha</p>\n<p class=\"mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#55605A]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"Arabic name and revelation row\">\n<span class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[15px] leading-[19px] text-[#0B1411]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Arabic surat name\" style=\"font-family:'Amiri',serif\">الفاتحة</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"revelation order label\">Nüzul 5</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"shrink-0 text-[11.5px] tabular-nums text-[#55605A]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-1-3\" data-name=\"ayat count\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">7 ayet</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-[62px] items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-[#DDE3E0] px-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-2\" data-name=\"surat row 2\">\n<span class=\"w-5 shrink-0 text-[11.5px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#9AA49E]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-2-1\" data-name=\"surat number\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">2</span>\n<div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-2-2\" data-name=\"surat names container\">\n<p class=\"truncate text-[14px] font-semibold leading-5 tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#0B1411]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Turkish surat name\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">Bakara</p>\n<p class=\"mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#55605A]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-2-2-2\" data-name=\"Arabic name and revelation row\">\n<span class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[15px] leading-[19px] text-[#0B1411]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Arabic surat name\" style=\"font-family:'Amiri',serif\">البقرة</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"revelation order label\">Nüzul 87</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"shrink-0 text-[11.5px] tabular-nums text-[#55605A]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-2-3\" data-name=\"ayat count\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">286 ayet</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-[62px] items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-[#DDE3E0] px-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-3\" data-name=\"surat row 3\">\n<span class=\"w-5 shrink-0 text-[11.5px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#9AA49E]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-3-1\" data-name=\"surat number\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">3</span>\n<div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-3-2\" data-name=\"surat names container\">\n<p class=\"truncate text-[14px] font-semibold leading-5 tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#0B1411]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-3-2-1\" data-name=\"Turkish surat name\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">Âl-i İmrân</p>\n<p class=\"mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#55605A]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-3-2-2\" data-name=\"Arabic name and revelation row\">\n<span class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[15px] leading-[19px] text-[#0B1411]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Arabic surat name\" style=\"font-family:'Amiri',serif\">آل عمران</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"revelation order label\">Nüzul 89</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"shrink-0 text-[11.5px] tabular-nums text-[#55605A]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-3-3\" data-name=\"ayat count\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">200 ayet</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-[62px] items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-[#DDE3E0] px-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-4\" data-name=\"surat row 4\">\n<span class=\"w-5 shrink-0 text-[11.5px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#9AA49E]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-4-1\" data-name=\"surat number\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">4</span>\n<div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-4-2\" data-name=\"surat names container\">\n<p class=\"truncate text-[14px] font-semibold leading-5 tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#0B1411]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-4-2-1\" data-name=\"Turkish surat name\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">Nisâ</p>\n<p class=\"mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#55605A]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-4-2-2\" data-name=\"Arabic name and revelation row\">\n<span class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[15px] leading-[19px] text-[#0B1411]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Arabic surat name\" style=\"font-family:'Amiri',serif\">النساء</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"revelation order label\">Nüzul 92</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"shrink-0 text-[11.5px] tabular-nums text-[#55605A]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-4-3\" data-name=\"ayat count\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">176 ayet</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-[62px] items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-[#DDE3E0] px-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-5\" data-name=\"surat row 5\">\n<span class=\"w-5 shrink-0 text-[11.5px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#9AA49E]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-5-1\" data-name=\"surat number\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">5</span>\n<div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-5-2\" data-name=\"surat names container\">\n<p class=\"truncate text-[14px] font-semibold leading-5 tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#0B1411]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-5-2-1\" data-name=\"Turkish surat name\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">Mâide</p>\n<p class=\"mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#55605A]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-5-2-2\" data-name=\"Arabic name and revelation row\">\n<span class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[15px] leading-[19px] text-[#0B1411]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-5-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Arabic surat name\" style=\"font-family:'Amiri',serif\">المائدة</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-5-2-2-2\" data-name=\"revelation order label\">Nüzul 112</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"shrink-0 text-[11.5px] tabular-nums text-[#55605A]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-5-3\" data-name=\"ayat count\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">120 ayet</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-[62px] items-center gap-3 px-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-6\" data-name=\"surat row 6\">\n<span class=\"w-5 shrink-0 text-[11.5px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#9AA49E]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-6-1\" data-name=\"surat number\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">6</span>\n<div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-6-2\" data-name=\"surat names container\">\n<p class=\"truncate text-[14px] font-semibold leading-5 tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#0B1411]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-6-2-1\" data-name=\"Turkish surat name\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">En'âm</p>\n<p class=\"mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#55605A]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-6-2-2\" data-name=\"Arabic name and revelation row\">\n<span class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[15px] leading-[19px] text-[#0B1411]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-6-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Arabic surat name\" style=\"font-family:'Amiri',serif\">الأنعام</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-6-2-2-2\" data-name=\"revelation order label\">Nüzul 55</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"shrink-0 text-[11.5px] tabular-nums text-[#55605A]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1-5-6-3\" data-name=\"ayat count\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">165 ayet</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- docked resume + khatm -->\n<div class=\"shrink-0 border-t-2 border-[#0B1411] bg-white px-4 pb-2 pt-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"docked resume and khatm panel\">\n<div class=\"flex h-12 items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"resume reading row\">\n<div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"resume info container\">\n<p class=\"text-[10.5px] leading-4 text-[#55605A]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"resume label\">Kaldığın yer</p>\n<p class=\"truncate text-[13px] font-semibold leading-5 tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#0B1411]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"resume position text\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">Bakara Suresi, 45. ayet</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-9 shrink-0 items-center rounded-[2px] bg-[#059669] px-3.5 text-[12px] font-semibold text-white shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#0B1411]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"read continuation button\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">Oku</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-9 items-center gap-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"khatm progress row\">\n<span class=\"shrink-0 text-[11.5px] text-[#55605A]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"khatm label\">Hatim</span>\n<span class=\"shrink-0 text-[11.5px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#0B1411]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"khatm completion count\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo'\">214/604</span>\n<div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-[2px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"khatm progress bar\">\n<span class=\"h-[4px] flex-1 bg-[#10B981]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"full progress segment\"></span>\n<span class=\"h-[4px] flex-1 bg-[#10B981]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"full progress segment\"></span>\n<span class=\"h-[4px] flex-1 bg-[#10B981]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"full progress segment\"></span>\n<span class=\"h-[4px] flex-1 bg-[#DDE3E0]\" 